  "raw_response": "def solve(grid):\n    h = len(grid)\n    w = len(grid[0]) if h else 0\n\n    out = [row[:] for row in grid]\n\n    # Find the template row: the row with the most 5s (typically the top row)\n    template_row_idx = None\n    template_cols = []\n    best_count = -1\n    for r in range(h):\n        cols = [c for c in range(w) if grid[r][c] == 5]\n        if len(cols) > best_count:\n            best_count = len(cols)\n            template_row_idx = r\n            template_cols = cols\n\n    if not template_cols:\n        return out\n\n    # Target rows are rows (other than the template row) that contain a single 5.\n    # In those rows, paint 2s at the template's 5-columns, but do not overwrite existing 5s.\n    for r in range(h):\n        if r == template_row_idx:\n            continue\n        five_cols = [c for c in range(w) if grid[r][c] == 5]\n        if len(five_cols) == 1:\n            for c in template_cols:\n                if out[r][c] == 0:\n                    out[r][c] = 2\n\n    return out",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    h = len(grid)\n    w = len(grid[0]) if h else 0\n\n    out = [row[:] for row in grid]\n\n    # Find the template row: the row with the most 5s (typically the top row)\n    template_row_idx = None\n    template_cols = []\n    best_count = -1\n    for r in range(h):\n        cols = [c for c in range(w) if grid[r][c] == 5]\n        if len(cols) > best_count:\n            best_count = len(cols)\n            template_row_idx = r\n            template_cols = cols\n\n    if not template_cols:\n        return out\n\n    # Target rows are rows (other than the template row) that contain a single 5.\n    # In those rows, paint 2s at the template's 5-columns, but do not overwrite existing 5s.\n    for r in range(h):\n        if r == template_row_idx:\n            continue\n        five_cols = [c for c in range(w) if grid[r][c] == 5]\n        if len(five_cols) == 1:\n            for c in template_cols:\n                if out[r][c] == 0:\n                    out[r][c] = 2\n\n    return out",
